WEBVTT

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:02.197
Some have succumbed
to the power of nature.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.663
And some have not.

00:04:04.663 --> 00:04:08.030
The view from the sky is so abstract.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.063
It reveals our connections,

00:04:10.063 --> 00:04:12.797
our continuity and our scale.

00:04:13.897 --> 00:04:17.597
Nevertheless, it's hard to see
the big picture right now.

00:04:18.063 --> 00:04:20.563
It's such a difficult time in the world

00:04:20.563 --> 00:04:23.063
as we pause and dismantle

00:04:23.063 --> 00:04:25.063
and rebuild our culture.

00:04:25.663 --> 00:04:27.563
I think back to my travels.

00:04:27.597 --> 00:04:31.463
I've seen how different we are,
how diverse and distinct.